# Playwright — everything below is a generated artifact.
#
# Screenshot baselines (tests/visual/__screenshots__) are NOT tracked. They are ~180 PNGs
# (~29 MB) that `npm run test:visual:update` regenerates locally, and they were previously
# untracked-but-unignored, so a plain `git add -A` would have committed 29 MB of rasterised
# fonts. They are also not stable enough to gate CI on: font rasterisation differs between
# runner images, which is why the PR workflow runs assertions only (--grep-invert on the
# screenshot specs) and the screenshot job is opt-in via workflow_dispatch.
#
# To review a visual diff: run `npm run test:visual:update`, inspect the PNGs locally, and
# discard them. Do not commit them.
tests/visual/__screenshots__
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
playwright/.cache
